# The cc dept.xlsx before/after snapshots stay LOCAL on purpose.
#
# They are a full copy of the Cost-Center -> Filler master: 213 rows carrying ~55 employee
# email addresses. Committing that into git puts a permanent employee-contact dump in history
# for no benefit, and the SIT safety rules already say evidence files report "counts plus one
# example row", never a roster.
#
# They are also not the revert path. Reverting is
#   python -X utf8 setup/ccdept_add_filler.py --remove --apply
# which recomputes from the LIVE file, and SharePoint's own version history (v58.0 is the
# pre-change version) is the authoritative record. The snapshots are belt-and-braces only.
#
# Everything else in this folder — MAP.md, tickets/, research/, and the Easy Auth config
# JSONs (GUIDs and a secret *name*, no secret values) — is committed.
*.xlsx
